{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "hosts-dcu",
    "project": "dcu-monitoring"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "主机与 DCU",
      "description": "数据源：test4 VictoriaMetrics。缺失或无效观测留空；默认 1 小时 / 15 秒刷新。"
    },
    "duration": "1h",
    "refreshInterval": "15s",
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "ListVariable",
        "spec": {
          "name": "node",
          "display": {
            "name": "节点"
          },
          "defaultValue": ".*",
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "StaticListVariable",
            "spec": {
              "values": [
                {
                  "value": ".*",
                  "label": "全部"
                },
                {
                  "value": "dcu1",
                  "label": "dcu1"
                },
                {
                  "value": "dcu2",
                  "label": "dcu2"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "ListVariable",
        "spec": {
          "name": "device",
          "display": {
            "name": "DCU"
          },
          "defaultValue": ".*",
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "StaticListVariable",
            "spec": {
              "values": [
                {
                  "value": ".*",
                  "label": "全部"
                },
                {
                  "value": "card0",
                  "label": "card0"
                },
                {
                  "value": "card1",
                  "label": "card1"
                },
                {
                  "value": "card2",
                  "label": "card2"
                },
                {
                  "value": "card3",
                  "label": "card3"
                },
                {
                  "value": "card4",
                  "label": "card4"
                },
                {
                  "value": "card5",
                  "label": "card5"
                },
                {
                  "value": "card6",
                  "label": "card6"
                },
                {
                  "value": "card7",
                  "label": "card7"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "p0": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "主机 CPU",
            "description": "指标含义\n主机 CPU 忙碌时间占总 CPU 时间的比例。当前查询扣除 idle 和 iowait，再按主机汇总；100% 表示接近全部 CPU 时间处于其余状态。iowait 被扣除，所以该图不能单独排除存储等待。\n\nY 轴单位\n百分比；图中 50 表示 50%，不是 0.5。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n速率使用最近 1 分钟滚动窗口；比例使用同一窗口的分子和分母。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 速率窗口的采样、生命周期或计数重置检查不通过时留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "%",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(100 * (1 - avg by(job,instance,node) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\",node=~\"$node\"}[1m]) + ignoring(mode) rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"iowait\",node=~\"$node\"}[1m])))) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}) < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p1": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "主机内存",
            "description": "指标含义\n主机内存已用量及总量：已用 = MemTotal − MemAvailable。MemAvailable 包含可回收内存的估算，因此不等于把所有缓存都视作不可用。每条曲线按节点和已用/总量区分。\n\nY 轴单位\nGiB；1 GiB = 2^30 字节。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "GiB",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "((node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{environment=\"dcu-pd\",node=~\"$node\"} - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{environment=\"dcu-pd\",node=~\"$node\"}) / 1024^3) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}) < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} 已用",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{environment=\"dcu-pd\",node=~\"$node\"} / 1024^3) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}) < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} 总量",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "文件系统容量使用率",
            "description": "指标含义\n文件系统容量占用比例：(1 − 可用字节/总字节) × 100%。按节点、设备或挂载点分别展示；可用空间采用普通用户可用口径。它是容量百分比，不是磁盘 I/O 忙碌率。\n\nY 轴单位\n百分比；图中 50 表示 50%，不是 0.5。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "%",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(100 * (1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{node=~\"$node\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|overlay|squashfs\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{node=~\"$node\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|devtmpfs|overlay|squashfs\"})) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}) < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{mountpoint}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p3": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "磁盘 I/O",
            "description": "指标含义\n设备读/写字节累计计数在最近 1 分钟的平均增长速率，除以 2^20。分别展示读和写及各设备；逻辑盘与其底层物理盘可能重复承载同一 I/O，不应把所有曲线直接相加。\n\nY 轴单位\nMiB / 秒；表示每秒的平均变化量。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n速率使用最近 1 分钟滚动窗口；比例使用同一窗口的分子和分母。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 速率窗口的采样、生命周期或计数重置检查不通过时留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "MiB / 秒",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(rate(node_disk_read_bytes_total{node=~\"$node\",device!~\"lo|loop.*|ram.*|veth.*|docker.*|br-.*\"}[1m]) / 1024^2) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}) < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{device}} 读",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(rate(node_disk_written_bytes_total{node=~\"$node\",device!~\"lo|loop.*|ram.*|veth.*|docker.*|br-.*\"}[1m]) / 1024^2) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}) < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{device}} 写",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p4": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "网络吞吐",
            "description": "指标含义\n网络接口接收/发送字节累计计数在最近 1 分钟的平均增长速率，除以 2^20。单位是字节速率，不是位速率；1 MiB/秒约等于 8.39 Mbit/秒。按节点、网卡及收发方向区分，部分虚拟接口被排除。\n\nY 轴单位\nMiB / 秒；表示每秒的平均变化量。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n速率使用最近 1 分钟滚动窗口；比例使用同一窗口的分子和分母。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。 速率窗口的采样、生命周期或计数重置检查不通过时留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "MiB / 秒",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{node=~\"$node\",device!~\"lo|loop.*|ram.*|veth.*|docker.*|br-.*\"}[1m]) / 1024^2) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}) < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{device}} 接收",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{node=~\"$node\",device!~\"lo|loop.*|ram.*|veth.*|docker.*|br-.*\"}[1m]) / 1024^2) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"node-.*\"}) < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{device}} 发送",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p5": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "DCU 利用率",
            "description": "指标含义\n每张 DCU 卡的设备利用率采样值。按节点和卡号分别展示；不是整个集群的平均值，也不是显存容量使用率。\n\nY 轴单位\n百分比；图中 50 表示 50%，不是 0.5。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "%",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(dcu_utilization_percent{node=~\"$node\",device=~\"$device\"} * 1) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}) < 15)) and on(job,instance) (dcu_sample_success == 1 and (time() - dcu_sample_timestamp_seconds < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{device}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p6": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "DCU 显存已用",
            "description": "指标含义\n每张 DCU 卡的已用显存字节数除以 2^30。按卡展示绝对容量；要判断显存是否接近耗尽，还需结合该卡总容量。\n\nY 轴单位\nGiB；1 GiB = 2^30 字节。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "GiB",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(dcu_memory_used_bytes{node=~\"$node\",device=~\"$device\"} * 9.313225746154785e-10) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}) < 15)) and on(job,instance) (dcu_sample_success == 1 and (time() - dcu_sample_timestamp_seconds < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{device}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p7": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "DCU 温度",
            "description": "指标含义\n每张 DCU 卡的当前设备温度。按节点和卡号区分；该图未设置统一安全温度阈值，应结合具体设备规格和历史基线判断。\n\nY 轴单位\n摄氏度。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "°C",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(dcu_temperature_celsius{node=~\"$node\",device=~\"$device\"} * 1) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}) < 15)) and on(job,instance) (dcu_sample_success == 1 and (time() - dcu_sample_timestamp_seconds < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{device}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p8": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "DCU 功耗",
            "description": "指标含义\n每张 DCU 卡的当前功率采样值。瓦特表示瞬时功率，不是累计耗电量；耗电量需要对功率随时间积分。\n\nY 轴单位\n瓦特。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n时间口径\n容量、队列和状态表示观测时刻值；服务请求/Token 速率由源监控按连续采样间隔计算。 当前看板默认最近 1 小时、15 秒刷新；X 轴为时间。刷新间隔与统计窗口是不同概念。\n\n零值与空白\n缺样、过期或有效性检查不通过时留空。No data 不等于零；正常有效的零值才表示测得为零。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "W",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(dcu_power_watts{node=~\"$node\",device=~\"$device\"} * 1) and on(job,instance) ((min_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"dcu-pd\",job=~\"dcu-.*\"}) < 15)) and on(job,instance) (dcu_sample_success == 1 and (time() - dcu_sample_timestamp_seconds < 15))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{device}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
